sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Primary as Primary (leader)
    participant Replica as Replica (follower)

    Client->>Primary: Write X = 100
    Primary->>Primary: Append to the WAL and commit
    Primary-->>Client: Write acknowledged
    Primary->>Replica: Stream the WAL entry
    Note over Primary,Replica: Replication lag window
    Client->>Replica: Read X during the lag
    Replica-->>Client: Stale value X = 50
    Replica->>Replica: Apply the WAL entry
    Client->>Replica: Read X after the apply
    Replica-->>Client: Fresh value X = 100
